OL,3,GNEWSADriver pleads guilty to causing
OL,4,Adeaths of married couple and friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man has pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fcausing the deaths of three people in a
OL,8,Fmulti-vehicle crash near Markethill,
OL,9,FCounty Armagh in November 2023.
OL,11,FJosh McGleenan of Ashveagh in Benburb
OL,12,Fhad been due to go on trial at Newry
OL,13,FCrown Court on Tuesday for causing the
OL,14,Fdeaths of Ciera Grimley and her husband
OL,15,FPatrick and their friend Ciara
OL,16,FMcElvanna.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
