OL,3,GNEWSADriver pleads guilty to causing
OL,4,Adeaths of married couple and friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fatal crash occurred on the Gosford
OL,7,FRoad between Markethill and Newry in
OL,8,Fthe early hours of 4 November when a
OL,9,Fminibus carrying a group from Dundalk
OL,10,FStadium was returning to the Madden
OL,11,Farea of County Armagh.
OL,13,FA jury had been selected on Monday but
OL,14,Fthe opening of that trial was delayed
OL,15,Fto allow for lengthy legal discussions
OL,16,Fto take place.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
